&lt;p&gt;There were a few main areas I could start from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being saved by Xie Lian as a child.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Him sneaking off to be a soldier to fight against Yong’an.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ghost fire adventures (my favourite personally)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wuming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mt Tonglu adventures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging 35 Heavenly Officials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting Xie Lian again + main story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I decided to go with the 33 heavenly officials plot because it seemed the most clear cut narrative and straightforward gameplay; fighting people, maybe Ace Attorney style debating, maybe some burning down of temples.&lt;/p&gt;
