&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 Waves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Player 300 hp &gt;&gt; 100 hp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Player and enemy health bars instead of a number&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;enemies attack u&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;diff kinds of enemies (ranged, charging, melee)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
