&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fixes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;teleport feature too broken (TOO GOOD), there was no range and the cooldown was ridiculously low&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img src=&quot;/d523467c9bbd8e6878805dbbd9a1eee0/gif_teleport.gif&quot;&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;playtesting the teleport feature, mutual agreement that it was too overpowered&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;glitch: cannot die&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img src=&quot;/9c6b2a8f02341ab46529b17ca30b75af/gif_glitchimmortal.gif&quot;&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;while playtesting we ran into a glitch where the player does not take damage from certain actions&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;third-day&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#third-day&quot; aria-label=&quot;third day permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Third Day&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were still concerned about the difficulty of the game,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img src=&quot;/d0a13dfea2b903ff81e0b65e5ea89f2a/gif_difficulty.gif&quot;&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;My friend commenting on the difficulty level of the game&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also added some new features:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;dodge ability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;limited the range of the teleport ability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balanced enemies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fixes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We found an unintended bug where the dodge ability literally slows down time, including the environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img src=&quot;/113f85fa593de458de900c6a8d98ae1f/gif_baddodge.gif&quot;&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Dodge ability slows down the environment, enemies, projectiles&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;While playtesting, we also found a bug where you can’t move while casting teleport. We realised it was unintuitive and unsatisfying to use, so we decided to change that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img src=&quot;/4fb779c92c26e88acbc6e9ab38309446/gif_badteleport1.gif&quot;&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Player cannot move during teleport.&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img src=&quot;/fc477a874a7100efe6bd7969eb9fd062/gif_badteleport.gif&quot;&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Unintuitive and hard to get used to.&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;fourth-day&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#fourth-day&quot; aria-label=&quot;fourth day permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Fourth Day&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;can move during teleport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img src=&quot;/4a83ff6c1338b4d8101020dd91f43e4f/gif_goodteleport.gif&quot;&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;teleport bug fixed so you can now move when activating teleport&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;dodge no longer slows time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;health regen orbs drop when enemies die&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;
  &lt;img src=&quot;/ad49abbf39435ce2ad46400c37860114/gif_orbdrop.gif&quot;&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;health regen orb drops&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fixes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;health regen drop too low chance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Made Mac and Window executables and uploaded it in a release on github! And the windows version can self-update. (I think.) Asked my non tech friends to try it out and it worked for them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
